# FinAlly

- Active spec: `planning/CURSOR_PLAN.md`. `planning/PLAN.md` is an archive (Docker / browser `:8000` / OpenRouter).
- Ship a **pywebview** desktop window. Do not treat “open http://localhost:8000” or Docker port-mapping as the product UX.
- FastAPI binds **`127.0.0.1` only**. Port 8000 is an internal sidecar bind.
- `backend/app/market/` is complete (cache, GBM simulator, Massive, SSE). Extend it; do not replace it.
- In-app LLM: OpenCode Zen (`OPENCODE_API_KEY`) or `LLM_MOCK=true`. No OpenRouter default. Use `.cursor/skills/zen-inference/SKILL.md` when writing chat/LLM code.
- Trading chat is structured JSON (message / trades / watchlist_changes). Do not wire it to OpenCode file or bash tools.
- SQLite path is `FINALLY_DB_PATH` or OS app-data (`FinAlly/finally.db`), not a Docker volume.
- One origin: Next.js static export served by FastAPI; pywebview loads that loopback URL. `user_id` stays on all tables. Keep Massive + simulator.
- Colors: bg `#0d1117` / `#1a1a2e`, yellow `#ecad0a`, blue `#209dd7`, purple `#753991`.
